&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The Senior Director, Revenue Marketing plays a critical role in driving pipeline and revenue growth within TripleLift&#39;s marketing organization, directly influencing how we convert our Creative SSP positioning into measurable business results. In this position, you will partner closely with the CRO, regional sales leaders, and Executive Leadership to shape full-funnel demand generation, ABM, and marketing operations strategy across North America and International markets. This is an exciting opportunity for someone who wants to architect and operate the engine connecting narrative to pipeline, pipeline to revenue, and strategy to execution, while building a modern, accountable marketing organization from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own marketing&#39;s contribution to pipeline creation, pipeline influence, and closed-won revenue, developing a full-funnel revenue marketing strategy aligned to company targets and reporting performance weekly and quarterly to ELT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead and scale a tiered account-based marketing strategy, orchestrating in-market and out-market campaigns, dynamic segmentation, and account-level personalization while refining attribution and journey-stage tracking in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Integrate events and sponsorships into account journey progression, establishing ROI measurement tied to pipeline impact and leading post-event nurture across paid, social, email, and direct mail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Oversee paid social, digital media, and emerging B2B channel investments, building campaigns aligned to account journey stage and optimizing continuously against engagement, cost efficiency, and pipeline impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead marketing operations, eliminating manual workflows, integrating cross-channel signals into Salesforce, and building closed-loop reporting that ties marketing activity to revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with the CRO and regional sales leaders on target account lists, pipeline coverage, campaign priorities, and regional revenue goals, supporting live opportunities through digital sales rooms and personalized materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team across events, paid media, social, and marketing operations, establishing performance metrics tied to pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in B2B revenue marketing, demand generation, or growth leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience within AdTech, MarTech, SaaS, or media platforms preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in ABM strategy and execution, with strong Salesforce and marketing automation fluency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven experience building attribution models and revenue reporting frameworks, with demonstrated ability to align marketing strategy to sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience leading events and field marketing programs tied to pipeline, with strong executive communication and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven leadership experience managing and developing high-performing, cross-functional marketing teams, with a track record of building a culture of accountability, experimentation, and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Jobs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;The base salary range represents the low and high end of the TripleLift US salary range for this position. Actual salaries will vary depending on factors including but not limited to experience and performance. The range listed is just one component of TripleLift’s total compensation package for employees. Other rewards may include bonuses, an open Paid Time Off policy, and many region-specific benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Pay is based on various non-discriminatory factors including but not limited to experience, education, and skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Benefits Available to Eligible Employees Include the following*:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, Dental &amp;amp; Vision Plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;401k w/ employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Full-time employees are eligible for comprehensive benefits (subject to the terms of applicable plans/policies/agreements, which will be made available to you after commencing employment).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At TripleLift, we believe great work starts with great people. We foster a culture built on collaboration, curiosity, and a shared commitment to making each other better. We move with urgency, challenge convention, and continuously innovate to elevate digital advertising. We value people who bring new perspectives, take ownership, and work together to drive meaningful impact. Learn more about TripleLift and our culture on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/triplelift/life/tripleliftpeopleculturecommunity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn Life page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://triplelift.com/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for information about how TripleLift handles personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TripleLift does not accept unsolicited resumes from recruitment search firms. Any resume submitted without a signed agreement in place will become the property of TripleLift, and no fee will be due.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
